Ah!

1022
01:22:13,108 --> 01:22:15,441
Aarrrgggghhh!!!

1023
01:23:06,025 --> 01:23:08,733
Não há mais desculpas.

1024
01:26:38,983 --> 01:26:41,566
Toque, toque, toque, Theo.

1025
01:26:48,316 --> 01:26:49,358
Vamos.

1026
01:26:49,400 --> 01:26:51,524
